@startuml
!include ./nora-medlink-style.puml
left to right direction
title Figure 3.19 — Nora MedLink DFD Level 0

actor Patient
actor Doctor
actor Administrator
rectangle "Nora MedLink System" as System
database "Nora MedLink Database" as DB
rectangle "OCR.Space Service" as OCR
rectangle "OpenAI Service" as OpenAI
rectangle "Notification Channel" as Notify

Patient --> System : Registration, reports, appointments,\nreminders and payments
Doctor --> System : Login, appointment review,\nauthorized patient data
Administrator --> System : Administrative status updates
System --> Patient : Dashboards, OCR results,\nsummaries and confirmations
System --> Doctor : Doctor dashboard and patient context
System --> Administrator : Management summaries
System <--> DB : Persistent healthcare records
System <--> OCR : Uploaded report images and OCR text
System <--> OpenAI : Clinical-support summary prompts and results
System --> Notify : Scheduled reminder notifications
Notify --> Patient : Reminder alerts
@enduml
